<title>PHILIPPINES: Ionics sets 10 centavo cash dividend.</title>
<headline>Ionics sets 10 centavo cash dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ionics Circuits Inc said on Thursday its board had approved a 10 centavo cash dividend to be paid to shareholders as of February 20.</p>
<p>The company also set a shareholders meeting on April 25.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
</text>
